<title>USA: ZEVEX Intl says deal with Mentor doubles.</title>
<headline>ZEVEX Intl says deal with Mentor doubles.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>ZEVEX International Inc said Friday its deal with Mentor H/S to design and produce ultrasonic surgical handpieces for liposuction surgery has more than doubled to about $4 million.</p>
<p>The original contract was signed in the first quarter of 1997, it said.</p>
